# Implement draft and send workflows

## Goal

Support deliberate composition and delivery without collapsing draft creation
and external side effects into one opaque action.

## Required work

- Create, read, update, and discard drafts.
- Implement send-draft, reply, reply-all, and forward.
- Define recipient normalization, MIME generation, and attachment constraints.
- Add idempotency and ambiguous-delivery handling.
- Require explicit send authority separate from draft authority.

## Acceptance criteria

- Draft operations cannot send mail.
- A retry cannot silently duplicate a confirmed delivery.
- Recipient, threading, Unicode, HTML/plain text, and attachment cases are
  tested.
- Ambiguous SMTP outcomes are surfaced instead of guessed.

## Evidence

- Synthetic SMTP integration suite
- Side-effect and idempotency tests
